\ Regression fixture: a public word tail-calls a private helper that references
\ a use-imported word. Mirrors lib/net/server.1z's serve-forever/serve-loop.
\
\ When public-tail is itself entered by a tail call, its module-deps frame is
\ loop-owned and dropped when it tail-calls (call-dep). (call-dep)'s source
\ module is the ephemeral <local-scope>, so local-scope must capture from-a into
\ that module's deps for the reference to still resolve after the frame drops.
use "mod_a.1z" ;

private{
  (call-dep): [ from-a ] ;
}

public-tail: [ (call-dep) ] ;
